          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wamakhela khona uJehova i-altare, wanikela ngeminikelo yokushiswa nangeminikelo yokuthula. Ngakho uJehova walithandazela izwe, futhi isifo sanqamuka kwa-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
